        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Lakes%2C_Las_Vegas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lake Sahara, a large man‑made lake, serves as the community’s centerpiece and namesake.",
